    stage-2: What should be the pattern on hashing
    counting + Hashing template

    stage-3: What should be the key for this 

    good-pairs: nums[i] + rev(nums[j]) == nums[j] + rev(nums[i])
        - performing algebric isolation:
            nums[i] - rev(nums[i]) == nums[j] - rev(nums[j])
        - reduced to 
            nums[i] - rev(nums[i])
    Key = nums[i] - rev(nums[i])

